# workspace/open reads its path as the gateway reads one (#451): an extension can't open a
# file in a hidden folder in the reader, as it can't read one with workspace/read.
# tests/drive.rs installs the open-tasks example patched to ask workspace/open for
# .obsidian/graph.json whenever the tasks change, and to show the refusal it hears.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 16 open tasks
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n
wait-for refused: .obsidian/graph.json: a path can't have .., . or hidden folders and files
expect-not reading · Esc / q back
screen
keys q
exits 0
